        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/attah_gibbor"/><tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/attah_gibbor/for_ever">Thou art for ever mighty, O Lord the reviver of the dead, Thou art great to save.</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/attah_gibbor/forever">Thou art forever mighty, O Lord the reviver of the dead, Thou art great to save.</j:option></tei:choice> </tei:p>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim"/><tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim/falling_and_healing">Sustaining life with kindness, reviving the dead with great compassion, supporting the falling and healing the sick and releasing captives and keeping His faith with those who sleep in the dust. Who is like Thee, Master of might, and who resembles Thee, O King, who slays and revives and causes salvation to spring forth.</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim/falling_healing">Sustaining life with kindness, reviving the dead with great compassion, supporting the falling, healing the sick, and releasing captives and keeping His faith with those who sleep in the dust. Who is like Thee, Master of might, and who resembles Thee, O King, who slays and revives and causes salvation to spring forth.</j:option></tei:choice> </tei:p>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mi_khamokha"/><tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mi_khamokha/compassion_with_comma">Who is like Thee, Father of compassion, who remembers His creatures for life in compassion.</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mi_khamokha/compassion_without_comma">Who is like Thee, Father of compassion who remembers His creatures for life in compassion;</j:option></tei:choice> </tei:p>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mechayyeh_hametim"/><tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mechayyeh_hametim/and_thou_lord_without_comma">And Thou art faithful to revive the dead. Blessed art Thou, O Lord who revives the dead.</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mechayyeh_hametim/and_thou_lord_with_comma">and Thou art faithful to revive the dead. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who revives the dead.</j:option></tei:choice> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
</tei:TEI>

